                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bd4d6186-6816-3514-9375-de805d14c847",
                        "entry_id": "9f72c4cf-860a-3c7a-b92d-b0812fc8a095",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A woman who is not a mother."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "94e28501-b65d-46fa-8ef7-54aacef248b9",
                                "sense_id": "bd4d6186-6816-3514-9375-de805d14c847",
                                "text": "How we lace away The hours interminable, Intricate and Pale, we nuns And all such unmothers of men;"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "774b7e60-f41a-4d74-91c2-3219500dab41",
                                "sense_id": "bd4d6186-6816-3514-9375-de805d14c847",
                                "text": "There is experimentation with sexuality, monogamy and nonmonogamy, mothers and \"unmothers,\" parenting by groups of bilogical and/or fictive kins, living in separate households and coparenting, etc."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "68f81c36-63bb-40cd-aa19-42808ba0bf69",
                                "sense_id": "bd4d6186-6816-3514-9375-de805d14c847",
                                "text": "So there are mothers and unmothers, and while neither choice is the easy one to make, motherhood is at least the comfortable one."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "630258ab-efe9-3a63-8dd5-7b8e9da7b3c7",
